# Implement

Follow the plan if one exists. Otherwise read AGENTS.md first.

Read BRANCHING.md before any git command.

Density is `{{config.design.density}}`.
{{#if flags.shadcn}}
shadcn components live in `components/ui`. Restyle them with tokens. The shadcn base color in `components.json` is only a starting point; `app/tokens.css` is the source of truth.
{{/if}}

Record the active branch when the task starts. Create the work branch from it and target the PR back into that recorded branch. Target `main` only if `main` was the recorded active branch. Do not switch to or merge `main` automatically.

1. Record the active branch.
2. Sync that recorded branch from origin. If it has no remote, use it as it is locally.
3. Create the work branch `<type>/<short-kebab-description>` from it. Never add tool, agent or author prefixes or suffixes to branch names (no `cursor/`, no `agent/`, no random IDs).
4. Implement the change. Use tokens from `app/tokens.css`. Stay under the file size limit in CODE_STYLE.md. Add or update tests when behavior changes. Do not expand the scope.
5. Run `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run build`.
6. Commit with Conventional Commits and push.
7. Open the pull request into the recorded branch.

Do not merge.
